印（陳尚君〈發現《全唐文》編修付刊的種種隱情〉（《文匯報》2019-09-20））。各館著錄作「武英殿刻本」「內府本」「揚州詩局刻本」「揚州官本」，刊年作 1814／1816／1818／1819 不等，皆此一副版片之異稱：1814 取序年，1816 取刻成，1818／1819 取補詩後印。光緒間廣雅書局另有重刻本（十三行二十五字），非此版。"},"edition":"清嘉慶二十一年揚州刻本（內府本）","id":"11sfkchnpaigw","juan_count":{"description":"一千卷，卷首四卷（NCPSSD 本題「總目三卷」）","number":1000},"measure_info":"一千卷","measures":[{"number":1000,"unit":"卷"}],"publication_info":{"details":"嘉慶十九年敕刊，兩淮鹽政阿克當阿等揚州監刻，二十一年刻成","year":"1816"},"related_books":["988mkgxd70","988g897bwk","988g1l5u6a","988g4twlca","988g8hxz40"],"resources":[{"details":"清華大學圖書館藏本 CADAL 掃描 DjVu，495 件，CADAL01022799–01023293 連號（件序即此處 volume 序；件與原書冊之對應未逐件核）。單半葉、二值、無水印。許可 PD-old。","id":"wikimedia","name":"Wikimedia Commons（CADAL·清華大學藏本）","short_name":"Commons·清華","types":["image"],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?search=CADAL0102+%E6%AC%BD%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%A8%E5%94%90%E6%96%87&title=Special%3AMediaSearch&type=other","volumes":[{"file":"File:CADAL01022799 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":1},{"file":"File:CADAL01022800 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":2},{"file":"File:CADAL01022801 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":3},{"file":"File:CADAL01022802 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":4},{"file":"File:CADAL01022803 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":5},{"file":"File:CADAL01022804 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":6},{"file":"File:CADAL01022805 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":7},{"file":"File:CADAL01022806 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":8},{"file":"File:CADAL01022807 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":9},{"file":"File:CADAL01022808 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":10},{"file":"File:CADAL01022809 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":11},{"file":"File:CADAL01022810 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":12},{"file":"File:CADAL01022811 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":13},{"file":"File:CADAL01022812 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":14},{"file":"File:CADAL01022813 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":15},{"file":"File:CADAL01022814 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":16},{"file":"File:CADAL01022815 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":17},{"file":"File:CADAL01022816 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":18},{"file":"File:CADAL01022817 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":19},{"file":"File:CADAL01022818 欽定全唐文.djvu","volume":20},{"file":"File:CADAL01022819 欽定全唐文.dj